   [
    "Which machines reach 12 percent",
    "<p>You need a treadmill that can set 12 percent or more. Most full-size folding treadmills reach 10 to 15 percent. Among walking pads, the DeerRun Z10 reaches 12 percent and the Urevo CyberPad reaches 14 percent, per the sellers' listings, though pads are limited to walking speeds, which is fine for 3 mph. Check that the incline setting is automatic, because a manual incline means stopping the belt to change it. For a hill-by-hill preview of other settings, use the incline calculator.</p>"
   ]
